Abstract
      


This document describes a syntax-independent model for business reports that
conform to the XBRL v2.1 and XBRL Dimensions v1.0 specifications.  The model is
intended to enable easy and lossless transformation of a well defined set of
semantics between a variety of different syntactic representations, including
the XML syntax defined in the above specifications.
    
      

    


